### Additional code fix

`generator_i2v_multinode.py` previously wrote every init frame to the fixed path `/tmp/magi1_init_frame.png`. This can corrupt the temporary PNG when multiple ranks or processes write/read it concurrently. It now writes process-unique temp PNGs under `/tmp/wmreward_magi1_init/`.

